
### 0. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### 1. 题目列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems

### 2. 题目详情（id=1）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems/1

### 3. 题目详情（不存在，应返回 404）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems/999


### ============ 下面是判题测试 ============
### 4. A+B 正确解 → 应该返回「通过」，3/3 用例
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 1,
  "code": "import java.util.Scanner; public class Main { public static void main(String[] a) { Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in); System.out.println(sc.nextInt() + sc.nextInt()); } }"
}

### 5. 故意输出 0 → 应该返回「答案错误」
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 1,
  "code": "import java.util.Scanner; public class Main { public static void main(String[] a) { Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in); sc.nextInt(); sc.nextInt(); System.out.println(0); } }"
}

### 6. 语法错误 → 应该返回「编译错误」
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 1,
  "code": "public class Main { public static void main(String[] a) { int x = ; } }"
}

### 7. 死循环 → 应该返回「超时」，大约 2 秒后
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 1,
  "code": "public class Main { public static void main(String[] a) { while (true) {} } }"
}

### 8. 除零 → 应该返回「运行错误」
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 1,
  "code": "public class Main { public static void main(String[] a) { int x = 1 / 0; } }"
}

### 9. 空代码 → 应该返回 400 参数错误
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problemId": 1,
  "code": ""
}
